%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A12_X1_1e
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: When we arrive backstage Aleph greets us with a bright smile.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca644bccb10bda444bd0ff07812d3a81, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Aleph! You were fantastic! It was really eye-opening, I knew you were
      a star, but you\u2019re a SUPERstar!"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Well, I\u2019m glad I was able to impress you."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He gives me a hug and whispers in my ear.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 2
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: -1
      targetScale: 1.5
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Next time I\u2019ll let you enjoy a private concert, just you and me."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What the hell?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 2
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: -1
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I hear an unfamiliar voice and feel Aleph suddenly get tense.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Who is that person Aleph? Why would you hug them?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I turn around to see one of Aleph\u2019s fans standing there, glaring
      at me."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Excuse me. You are not allowed in here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62e84d2ec46b1f44d8a2b8c9e355591d, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He glances around.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Security!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62e84d2ec46b1f44d8a2b8c9e355591d, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The fan quickly taps away on their phone and then starts to walk towards
      us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Let me and my friends also get a hug from you Aleph, they should be on
      the way now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2076be03fd0e341820320543a0afaf, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph slowly backs away towards the emergency exit door while holding my
      hand.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Sorry, that won\u2019t be happening. Please leave."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cc2076be03fd0e341820320543a0afaf, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Where the heck is security??
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "James is currently searching for any security guard but they haven\u2019t
      arrived yet."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We hear more footsteps just outside the backstage area, where I came from
      earlier.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Some fans must have come back after this one contacted them. Probably shared
      their location or something.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Let\u2019s run."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I agree.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just when a group of excited looking fans burst into the room we dash out
      using the emergency exit behind us and run towards parking lot.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 16ca264c6cacd35499c800f81bccc806, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4b5196fdcd752c3489bd945d4a242d70, type: 2}
